    <!--
      Firestore database id for project paper-docs-006.

      The database was created in the console with the literal name "default". That is NOT the
      built-in "(default)" database, so the client must be pointed at it explicitly.

      Leave this empty to target the built-in "(default)" database instead.

      CloudSync reads this at runtime via FirebaseFirestore.getInstance(databaseId).
    -->
